        "scent-rich-text-02": {
          "type": "rich_text",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<h3><strong>STATIC ELECTRICITY 30ml</strong></h3><p>Static Electricity is a moment caught mid-charge - the air just before lightning touches glass. In the split second before lightning strikes, the air changes - ions leap, and the sky tastes faintly metallic. Static Electricity captures the charged atmosphere: the crisp clarity of ionised air, softened by the grounding warmth of musk. </p><p>Born from the same forces that arc through my high-voltage glass sculptures, it carries the sensation of energy held in suspension.</p><p></p>",
            "spacing_above": "1",
            "spacing_below": "1"
          }
        },
