        "rich_text_Jcy6DE": {
          "type": "rich_text",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<p><strong>KITES WEARABLE SCULPTURE 60ml</strong></p><p>Handmade cast glass wearable sculpture with internal relief. Includes dropper and refillable STATIC ELECTRICITY scent.</p><p>Each hand-cast bottle carries a relief inspired by airflow patterns and corrupted weather satellite scans, turning atmospheric motion into a tactile form. The internal relief echoes storm systems, signal noise, and shifting currents - an object of scent shaped by weather, data, and distortion.</p><p><em>limited edition of 20, </em><strong>£3,700</strong></p><p><em>made to order, lead time 2 weeks</em></p>",
